  "final_answer": "Fixed two bugs in pager.py:\n\n1. `paginate`: used `page * per_page` as the slice start, which made page 1 start at the second page. Changed to `(page - 1) * per_page` for 1-based pages.\n2. `page_count`: used floor division (`total // per_page`), which undercounts. Changed to ceiling division (`-(-total // per_page)`), which also yields 0 for 0 items.\n\nAll 3 tests in test_pager.py now pass.",
  "warmup_s": 0.7
 },
